  <name>QtreGB</name>
  <summary>DMG Game Boy emulator with SDL2 and ImGui</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      QtreGB is a DMG Game Boy emulator written in C++17. The CPU uses a
      micro-op pipeline and the PPU is a native dot-driven implementation.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>DMG Game Boy emulation with SDL2 and ImGui.</li>
      <li>Save-state slots, battery saves and RTC support.</li>
      <li>Single-player and Link cable sessions.</li>
      <li>English and Spanish UI.</li>
      <li>Desktop launcher support for .gb files.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
